  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo Sikukuu ya Pasaka kala ikafika phephi, na Jesu kala anamanya kukala wakatiwe wa kuuka himu duniani na kuuya kpwa Ise ukafika. Wamendza atue osi okala anamkuluphira himu duniani, na achiaonyesa mendzwaye hadi mwisho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuriphofika dziloni, Jesu na anafundzie kala asegere anarya. Shetani kala akamupha Juda, mwana wa Simoni Isikarioti, maazo ga kumsalata Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu kala anamanya kukala wala kpwa Mlungu na andauya kpwa Mlungu. Na piya wamanya kukala Ise wamupha chila chitu chikale tsini ya uwezowe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi waunuka hipho chakuryani, achivula nguwoye ya dzulu, na achidzifunga nguwo chibiruni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu achitiya madzi karaini, na achiandza kusinga magulu anafundzie na achiafuta na hira nguwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphomfikira Simoni Petero, Petero wamuamba, “Bwana, kpwa utu wani uwe unisinge mimi magulu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achimuamba, “Hipha sambi kumanya nihendaro, ela badaye undamanya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero achimuamba, “Kundanisinga magulu hata chidide.” Ela achiambwa, “Nisiphokusinga magulu, phahi kundakala wangu tsona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Simoni Petero achiamba, “Bwana, usinisinge magulu bahi, ela nisinga mikono na chitswa piya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiambwa, “Mutu yeyesi achiyeoga kare ni mswafi. Kana lazima ya kuoga tsona, labuda asisinge magulu bahi. Phahi hata dzagbwe mkaera, ela simwi mosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu kala anammanya kare ndiyemsalata, ndiyo mana waamba, “Mkaera, ela simwi mosi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
